    <link>https://www.lemonde.fr/international/live/2026/10/03/en-direct-guerre-en-ukraine-les-services-de-renseignements-ukrainiens-s-attendent-a-une-intensification-des-operations-hybrides-russes-en-europe_6783795_3210.html</link>
